BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:lego-pokemon-go-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260919T080230Z
SUMMARY:LEGO Stores and Pokémon GO
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260803T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260930T235900
DESCRIPTION:The Pokémon GO and LEGO Group partnership continues for Traine
 rs in the US\, UK\, Poland\, France\, Germany\, and Australia! Visit parti
 cipating LEGO Store locations for raids\, a LEGO-themed stamp rally\, even
 t stickers\, and LEGO Pokémon SMART Play.\nThe LEGO Stores and Pokémon G
 O event will take place from August 3\, 2026 at 10 am to September 30\, 20
 26 at 11 pm.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Participating LEGO Store Locat
 ions\nYou can use this interactive map to find participating stores near y
 ou. This list is from the official Stamp Rally map.\nThe interactive map w
 ill load when it is near the screen.\nOpen the official map\n\n▸ Stamp R
 ally\nTake part in a special LEGO-themed stamp rally during the event! A s
 tamp rally is an activity where you collect stamps at certain PokéStops a
 nd Gyms. Explore participating LEGO Stores and find designated stops to co
 llect stamps\, which leads to encounters with Pikachu that have a Special 
 Background.\nStamps can be collected at select LEGO Stores in Australia\, 
 France\, Great Britain\, Germany\, Poland\, and the United States.\nTraine
 rs can start the stamp rally by visiting a participating LEGO Store until 
 September 30\, 2026 at 11:59 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ How stamp rallies wor
 k\nOrange stamp icons will be displayed above the PokéStops included in t
 he stamp rally. When you tap on these PokéStops\, the stamp sheet will ap
 pear so you can collect your stamp.\nYou can view the stamps you collect o
 n the stamp rally page in your Scrapbook. Certain stamp rallies also let y
 ou send stamps to your friends along with a Gift. Stamps you get from Gift
 s will be collected in your Scrapbook\, but they don’t count toward the 
 reward track. Rewards can only be obtained when you visit the location and
  collect the stamps yourself.\nLearn more about how to participate in a st
 amp rally here!\nPokémon: Pikachu\n\n▸ LEGO Pokémon SMART Play\nFrom A
 ugust 3 to September 30\, 2026\, Trainers are invited to enter LEGO Stores
  in the US\, UK\, Poland\, France\, Germany\, and Australia to visit in-st
 ore Trainer Centers and participate in the LEGO Pokémon SMART Play demo. 
 Participants will receive a unique collectible SMART Play Tag and a specia
 l stamp for their LEGO Passports. Smart Tags are available while stocks la
 st.\n…\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\nThe following Pokémon will appear more f
 requently in raids at participating LEGO Store locations. You may encounte
 r one with a Special Background!\nThese raids are local only—Remote Raid
  Passes cannot be used. Trainers can participate in one raid per day per s
 tore.\n\n▸ Appearing in 1-Star Raids\nPokémon: Pikachu\n\n━━ RESEAR
 CH ━━\nFree Timed Research will be available to Trainers who visit a L
 EGO Store during the event! Complete the research tasks to earn event stic
 kers\, the 2026 LEGO® Pokémon Jacket\, and more.\nRedeem promo code LEGO
 xPOKEMONGOxCAP to unlock Bonus Timed Research. The Cap Timed Research is o
 nly available in select countries\, including but not exclusive to the one
 s mentioned with participating LEGO Stores. Trainers in countries that are
  not included will get Timed Research that rewards a Lucky Egg instead.\nT
 rainers outside the Cap Timed Research countries receive this Timed Resear
 ch instead.\n\n▸ Possible workaround\nSome Trainers have reported being 
 able to receive the Cap Timed Research with these steps:\n• Turn off loc
 ation/GPS on your phone\, then launch Pokémon GO.\n• Open the Research 
 tab.\n• Close the game.\n• Turn on location/GPS\, open the game again\
 , and the Cap Timed Research should be there.\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com
 /events/lego-pokemon-go-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/lego-pokemon-go-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
