BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:go-pass-september-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260919T080230Z
SUMMARY:GO Pass: September
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260908T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261006T100000
DESCRIPTION:Latios soars in faster than a jet for GO Pass: September!\nThe 
 GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe for September will be available from September 
 8\, 2026 at 10:00 am to October 6\, 2026 at 10:00 am local time.\n\n━━
  FEATURES ━━\n▸ GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe\nTrainers will automatica
 lly receive GO Pass: September on Tuesday\, September 8\, at 10:00 a.m. lo
 cal time. You can collect GO Points and rank up to get additional rewards 
 through Tuesday\, October 6\, at 10:00 a.m. local time.\nAdditionally\, fr
 om Saturday\, October 3\, at 12:00 a.m. to Sunday\, October 4\, at 11:59 p
 .m. local time\, there’s no daily limit for how many GO Points you can e
 arn!\nFor US$7.99\, Trainers can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe\, a paid ve
 rsion of the GO Pass that offers upgraded rewards and faster progression.\
 nFor US$9.99*\, Trainers can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe + 10 Ranks to a
 lso automatically earn enough GO Points to reach Rank 11.\nWhile progressi
 ng through the GO Pass Deluxe\, you’ll be able to claim all of the rewar
 ds from both the free GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe. You can upgrade to a GO 
 Pass Deluxe at any time and still collect rewards from previously unlocked
  ranks.\nRewards unlocked in the GO Pass will expire on Thursday\, October
  8\, at 10:00 a.m. local time\, so be sure to claim your rewards before th
 ey’re gone!\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon and Rewards\nComplete Pass Tasks to
  rank up your GO Pass to earn the following rewards.\n• Encounter with L
 atios*\n• Rare Candy XL\n• Premium Battle Pass\n• Lucky Egg\n• And
  even more goodies!\nTrainers who upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe can also e
 arn the following rewards.\n• One Timed Incubator\n• One Super Incubat
 or\n• Additional encounters with even more Pokémon!\n• And even more 
 goodies!\n\n▸ Major Milestone Bonuses\nReach Major Milestones on your GO
  Pass to unlock the following bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 – Rank 1\n• One a
 dditional Candy for trading Pokémon\n• Trainers level 31 and above will
  receive one guaranteed Candy XL when trading Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 2 – R
 ank 25\n• Open up to 40 Gifts per day\n• Receive up to 125 Gifts per d
 ay from spinning PokéStop and Gym Photo Discs\n• Hold 10 more Gifts in 
 your Item Bag\n\n▸ Tier 3 – Rank 50\n• 2× Daily Adventure Incense d
 uration\n\n▸ Tier 4 – Rank 75\n…\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\nEarn poin
 ts to increase your rank and unlock rewards. You can earn points by comple
 ting Pass Tasks or the various accomplishments listed here. Any rewards yo
 u earn for completing a Pass Task will be awarded as soon as you finish th
 e task.\nTrainers will also have access to Weekly Tasks to earn points and
  increase their rank. The Weekly Tasks are as follows:\n• Catch 75 Poké
 mon - 200 PTS\n• Win a raid - 150 PTS\n• Make 20 Great Throws - 150 PT
 S\n• Hatch 3 Eggs - 150 PTS\n• Spin 25 PokéStops or Gyms - 100 PTS\n
 • Use 20 Berries to help catch Pokémon - 100 PTS\n• Earn 10 hearts wi
 th your buddy - 150 PTS\nThere is also a daily task:\nGO Pass: September D
 aily\n• Catch 15 Pokémon - 200 PTS\nGO Pass Deluxe: September Daily\n
 • Catch 15 Pokémon - 200 PTS\nTrainers can earn up to 250 extra points 
 daily by completing certain tasks.\n• Win a raid - 100 PTS\n• Hatch an
  Egg - 40 PTS\n• Catch a Pokémon - 5 PTS\n\n▸ GO Pass: September\nEnc
 ounter Latios!\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-september-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/go-pass-september-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:season-24-twilight-trails@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260919T080230Z
SUMMARY:Season: Twilight Trails
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260908T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261201T100000
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Pokémon GO: Twilight Trails!\nIn Pokémon GO\, Seas
 ons are periods of time that feature new events\, Pokémon debuts\, and su
 rprises that all follow a certain theme. As the Seasons change\, you may f
 ind different Pokémon appearing in your area and hatching from Eggs. Make
  sure to explore during each in-game Season to collect and train as many d
 ifferent Pokémon as you can! You’ll also enjoy special bonuses as you d
 o.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n▸ GO Pass Major Milestone Bonuses\nReach Ma
 jor Milestones on your GO Pass to unlock the following bonuses. Once unloc
 ked\, these bonuses will last until the current GO Pass ends!\n\n▸ Rank 
 1\n• One guaranteed Candy XL when trading Pokémon for Trainers level 31
  and above\n• One additional Candy for trading Pokémon\n\n▸ Rank 25\n
 • Increased limits on opening Gifts\, receiving Gifts from PokéStop and
  Gym Photo Discs\, and storing Gifts\n\n▸ Rank 50\n• 2× Daily Adventu
 re Incense duration\n\n▸ Rank 75\n• Increased XP and Stardust from hat
 ching Eggs\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Debuts\nMore Pokémon o
 riginally discovered in the Paldea region\, which was featured in the Pok
 émon Scarlet and Pokémon Violet games for Nintendo Switch\, have been sp
 otted in Pokémon GO!\nBe on the lookout for Maschiff\, Mabosstiff\, and m
 ore!\nPokémon: Maschiff\, Mabosstiff\n\n▸ Mega-Evolved Pokémon\nWhere 
 Pokémon GO Fest 2026: Mega Finale ends\, a new trail begins! Gather ‘ro
 und for the Mega Evolution debuts of Staraptor\, Chandelure\, and more dur
 ing Twilight Trails.\nStay tuned for more details on how to continue your 
 Mega Evolution journey with the Mega Squads event\, September Community Da
 y Classic\, and more!\n\n▸ Max Pokémon Debuts\nDynamax Rhyhorn\, Dynama
 x Sneasel\, Dynamax Sizzlipede\, and more will make their way into Max Bat
 tles throughout the Season. Keep an eye out for new Dynamax Pokémon at Po
 wer Spots!\nDynamax Uxie\, Dynamax Mesprit\, and Dynamax Azelf will appear
  in a Max Battle Day during Twilight Trails.\nPokémon: Rhyhorn\, Sneasel\
 , Uxie\, Mesprit\, Azelf\, Sizzlipede\n\n▸ Daily Discoveries\nThroughout
  Twilight Trails\, different days of the week will include a Daily Discove
 ry experience. These will be active between 12:00 a.m. and 11:59 p.m. loca
 l time unless otherwise stated. Daily Discoveries may change as Scopely Ex
 plore experiments with how to make the best experience.\nPlease note: Dail
 y Discoveries will not be available during the week of global GO Fest\, GO
  Wild Area\, and GO Tour events.\n\n▸ Community Days\nMark your calendar
 ! Twilight Trails will have Community Day events on the following dates.\n
 • September 12 — September Community Day Classic\n• October 10 — O
 ctober Community Day\n• November 21 — November Community Day\n\n▸ GO
  Pass\nGO Pass\, a limited-time progression track\, will be available duri
 ng Twilight Trails! Complete Pass Tasks to earn GO Points to increase your
  rank and earn rewards.\nThe GO Pass Deluxe\, a paid version of the GO Pas
 s\, will be available for Trainers looking for upgraded rewards and faster
  progression.\n\n▸ Research Breakthrough\n…\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\n
 ▸ Wild Pokémon Encounters\nAs the Seasons change\, you may find differe
 nt Pokémon appearing in your area. Explore during Twilight Trails to see 
 what discoveries await!\n\n━━ EGGS ━━\nHere are some of the Pokém
 on hatching from Eggs this season.\nThere are more Pokémon appearing in E
 ggs than the ones listed.\n\n▸ In 2 km Eggs\nPokémon: Elekid\, Magby\, 
 Azurill\n\n▸ In 5 km Eggs\nRegional: Mime Jr. is exclusive to Eggs obtai
 ned in Europe.\nPokémon: Mime Jr.\, Munchlax\, Larvesta\, Sizzlipede\, Sn
 om\, Indeedee (Male)\, Indeedee (Female)\, Fidough\, Maschiff\n\n▸ In 5 
 km Eggs from Adventure Sync Rewards\nPokémon: Tyrogue\, Sableye\, Budew\n
 \n▸ In 7 km Eggs\nPokémon: Galarian Meowth\, Galarian Zigzagoon\, Galar
 ian Stunfisk\n\n▸ In 7 km Eggs From Route Rewards\nThis type of Egg is o
 btained from Mateo’s Gift Exchange at the end of a Route.\nPokémon: Gal
 arian Slowpoke\, Hisuian Sneasel\, Galarian Corsola\n\n▸ In 10 km Eggs\n
 Pokémon: Dratini\, Honedge\, Impidimp\n\n▸ In 10 km Eggs from Adventure
  Sync Rewards\nPokémon: Bagon\, Druddigon\, Drampa\n\n🔗 https://leekdu
 ck.com/events/season-24-twilight-trails/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/season-24-twilight-trails/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
