DTEND:20260922T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:The Great League\, Ultra League: Mega Edition\, and Willpower C
 up: Great League Edition will run from September 15\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. 
 to September 22\, 2026\, at 1:00 p.m. PT.\n\n▸ Great League\n• Pokémo
 n must be at or below 1\,500 CP to enter.\n\n▸ Ultra League: Mega Editio
 n\n• Pokémon must be at or below 2\,500 CP to enter.\n• Mega-Evolved 
 Pokémon are allowed.\n\n▸ Willpower Cup: Great League Edition\n• Pok
 émon must be at or below 1\,500 CP to enter.\n• Only Fighting-\, Psychi
 c-\, and Dark-type Pokémon are eligible.\nThe following Pokémon will not
  be allowed.\nPokémon: Gardevoir\, Zorua\, Zoroark\n\n🔗 https://leekdu
 ck.com/events/gbl-twilight-trails_great-league_ultra-league-mega-edition_w
 illpower-cup-great-league-edition/
