BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pokemon-horizons-the-series-celebration-event-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260919T080230Z
SUMMARY:Pokémon Horizons: The Series Celebration Event 2026
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260916T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260922T200000
DESCRIPTION:The Pokémon Horizons: The Series Celebration Event returns to 
 Pokémon GO with the debut of Charmander wearing Friede’s goggles and it
 s Evolutions!\nUS fans can watch Pokémon Horizons: Season 3—Rising Hope
  on Netflix now. For more information\, visit the Pokémon Horizons websit
 e.\nUK fans can watch Pokémon Horizons: Season 3—Rising Hope on BBC iPl
 ayer. For more information\, visit the Pokémon animation website.\nFor fa
 ns in other regions\, please check availability with your local providers.
 \n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased chance to encounter Kecleon at Po
 kéStops\nReach Major Milestones on your event GO Pass to unlock the follo
 wing bonuses.\n\n▸ Tier 1 Bonus – Starting at Rank 1\n• 2× Candy fo
 r catching Pokémon\n• GO Pass Deluxe: 3× Candy for catching Pokémon\n
 \n▸ Tier 2 Bonus – Starting at Rank 10\n• Regular Lure Modules will 
 last for one hour and may attract the featured Pokémon\n\n▸ Tier 3 Bonu
 s – Starting at Rank 20\n• Additional Stardust for catching Hatenna an
 d Wattrel\nKeep an eye out for additional bonus tasks for this GO Pass dur
 ing the event!\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Pokémon Debut\nA new costum
 ed Pokémon will appear during this event! You might find one in the wild\
 , from Field Research\, attracted by an active regular Lure Module\, or vi
 a the GO Pass.\nPokémon: Charmander wearing Friede's goggles\, Charmeleon
  wearing Friede's goggles\, Charizard wearing Friede's goggles\nYou can us
 e 25 Charmander Candy to evolve Charmander wearing Friede’s goggles into
  Charmeleon wearing Friede’s goggles and 100 Charmander Candy to evolve 
 Charmeleon wearing Friede’s goggles into Charizard wearing Friede’s go
 ggles.\nIf you’re lucky\, you might encounter a Shiny one or one that ha
 s a Special Background!\n\n▸ PokéStop Showcases\nBe on the lookout for 
 Showcases at different PokéStops during the event\, where each day will f
 eature a new category!\n\n▸ Surprise Encounters\nSmile! You might have a
  surprise encounter with characters and Pokémon seen in Pokémon Horizons
 : The Series when you take a snapshot during the event!\nYou can receive u
 p to 5 surprise snapshot encounters per day during the event.\nPossible Po
 kémon encounters include:\nPokémon: Charizard wearing Friede's goggles\,
  Captain's Cap Pikachu\, Meowscarada\, Skeledirge\, Quaquaval\n\n▸ Spotl
 ight Hour\nCharmander wearing Friede’s goggles Spotlight Hour takes plac
 e on Thursday\, September 17\, 2026\, from 6:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. local ti
 me. Charmander wearing Friede’s goggles will appear more frequently in t
 he wild\, and Trainers will earn 2× Stardust for catching Pokémon.\n\n
 ━━ SPAWNS ━━\n▸ Wild Encounters\nDuring the event\, the followin
 g Pokémon will appear in the wild during these times (local time).\n\n▸
  From 5:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m.\nPokémon: Charmander wearing Friede's goggle
 s\, Sprigatito\, Fuecoco\, Quaxly\, Fidough\, Wattrel\nYou might even enco
 unter the following!\nPokémon: Captain's Cap Pikachu\, Chansey\n\n▸ Fro
 m 5:00 p.m. to 5:00 a.m.\nPokémon: Charmander wearing Friede's goggles\, 
 Rhyhorn\, Eevee\, Hatenna\, Nacli\, Tinkatink\nYou might even encounter th
 e following!\nPokémon: Captain's Cap Pikachu\, Rockruff\n\n━━ RAIDS 
 ━━\nThe following Pokémon will appear in raids. If you’re lucky\, y
 ou might encounter a Shiny one or one that has a Special Background!\n\n
 ▸ One-Star Raids\nPokémon: Captain's Cap Pikachu\n\n▸ Three-Star Raid
 s\nPokémon: Charizard wearing Friede's goggles\, Meowscarada\, Skeledirge
 \, Quaquaval\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Field Research Task Encounters
 \nEvent-themed Field Research tasks will be available!\nComplete Field Res
 earch tasks to earn encounters with event-themed Pokémon. Available tasks
  and encounters vary by time of day (local time).\n\n▸ From 5:00 a.m. to
  5:00 p.m.\n• Catch 10 Fire‑type Pokémon → Charmander wearing Fried
 e's goggles\, Fidough\, Wattrel\n• Make an Excellent Throw → Charmande
 r wearing Friede's goggles\n• Make 5 Great Throws → Sprigatito\, Fueco
 co\, Quaxly\n• Win a raid → Chansey\, Lapras\n• Win 2 raids → Capt
 ain's Cap Pikachu\n\n▸ From 5:00 p.m. to 5:00 a.m.\n• Catch 10 Fire‑
 type Pokémon → Charmander wearing Friede's goggles\, Eevee\, Hatenna\n
 • Make an Excellent Throw → Charmander wearing Friede's goggles\n• M
 ake 5 Great Throws → Rhyhorn\, Nacli\n• Win a raid → Rockruff\, Tink
 atink\n• Win 2 raids → Captain's Cap Pikachu\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\
 n▸ GO Pass: Collaboration Celebration Event\nThe GO Pass and GO Pass Del
 uxe for the Pokémon Horizons: The Series Celebration Event will be availa
 ble from Wednesday\, September 16\, at 10:00 a.m. to Tuesday\, September 2
 2\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ GO Pass and GO Pass Deluxe\nA G
 O Pass is a free\, limited-time progression track available during a speci
 fied period. By collecting GO Points\, you can increase your rank to earn 
 rewards.\nTrainers will automatically receive GO Pass: Collaboration Celeb
 ration Event on Wednesday\, September 16\, at 10:00 a.m. local time. You c
 an collect GO Points and rank up to get additional rewards through Tuesday
 \, September 22\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\nFor US$4.99*\, Trainers
  can upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe\, a paid version of the GO Pass that of
 fers upgraded rewards and faster progression.\nFor US$6.99*\, Trainers can
  upgrade to the GO Pass Deluxe + 6 Ranks to also automatically earn enough
  GO Points to reach Rank 7.\nWhile progressing through the GO Pass Deluxe\
 , you’ll be able to claim all of the rewards from both the free GO Pass 
 and GO Pass Deluxe. You can upgrade to a GO Pass Deluxe at any time and st
 ill collect rewards from previously unlocked ranks.\nRewards unlocked in t
 he GO Pass will expire on Thursday\, September 24\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. lo
 cal time\, so be sure to claim your rewards before they’re gone!\n\n▸ 
 Featured Pokémon and Rewards\nComplete Pass Tasks to rank up your GO Pass
  to earn the following rewards.\n• Encounters with event-themed Pokémon
 \n• XP\n• Lure Module\n• And even more goodies!\nTrainers who upgrad
 e to the GO Pass Deluxe can also earn the following rewards.\n• Addition
 al encounters with even more Pokémon!\n• Premium Battle Passes\n• Rar
 e Candy XL\n• And even more goodies!\n\n▸ Daily Tasks\n…\n\n━━ S
 HINY ━━\n…
