SUMMARY:Staraptor Super Mega Raid Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260919T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260919T170000
DESCRIPTION:Ready yourself to courageously challenge Staraptor Super Mega R
 aid Day!\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Remote Raid limit increased to 20 f
 rom Friday\, September 18\, at 5:00 p.m. to Saturday\, September 19\, 2026
 \, at 8:00 p.m. PDT\n• Receive up to six free Raid Passes from spinning 
 Gym Photo Discs\n• Staraptor caught from Super Mega Raids will have Mega
  Level 1 unlocked\n• Increased chance of encountering Shiny Staraptor fr
 om Super Mega Raids\n\n▸ Event Ticket\nFor US$4.99 (or the equivalent pr
 icing tier in your local currency)\, you can purchase a ticket that grants
  the following bonuses.\n• Receive up to 14 Raid Passes from spinning Gy
 m Photo Discs\n• Increased chance to get Rare Candy XL from Raid Battles
 \n• An additional 5\,000 XP from Super Mega Raid Battles\n• An additio
 nal 5\,000 Stardust from Super Mega Raid Battles\nThese bonuses will be ef
 fective on Saturday\, September 19\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. lo
 cal time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Mega-Evolved Pokémon Debut\nThe 
 following Pokémon will make its Pokémon GO debut in Super Mega Raids!\nP
 okémon: Mega Staraptor\n\n▸ New Mega Level: Super Max\nMega Staraptor
 ’s Mega Level can be increased all the way to Super Max Level for the fi
 rst time in Pokémon GO!\nPokémon that are eligible to unlock Super Max L
 evel can learn an additional Charged Attack while they are Mega Evolved.\n
 Staraptor can use the additional Charged Attack Brave Bird+ while it is Me
 ga Evolved.\n• Trainer Battles: 70 power and decreases the user’s Defe
 nse by three stages\n• Raid Battles: 150 power\nThe power of this attack
  will increase with Staraptor’s Mega Level.\nYou must increase a Pokémo
 n’s Mega Level to Max before you can increase it to Super Max. Participa
 ting in Mega Raids awards the Mega Energy needed to power up eligible Pok
 émon beyond what Mega Evolving alone can provide.\n\n▸ Where can I find
  Super Mega Raids?\nSuper Mega Raids will take great teamwork and may only
  appear at certain Gyms.\n\n━━ RAIDS ━━\n▸ Featured Pokémon\nMe
 ga Staraptor will make its Pokémon GO debut in Super Mega Raids.\nPokémo
 n: Mega Staraptor\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\nTimed Research will be availa
 ble to Trainers during the event. Complete the research tasks to earn a Pr
 emium Battle Pass and an encounter with Gardevoir.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\
 nTrainers will have an increased chance of encountering Shiny Staraptor fr
 om Super Mega Raids.\nPokémon: Staraptor\, Mega Staraptor\n\n🔗 https:/
 /leekduck.com/events/staraptor-super-mega-raid-day-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/staraptor-super-mega-raid-day-2026/
