DTSTAMP:20260919T080230Z
SUMMARY:Harvest Festival 2026: Applin Picking
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20260929T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261005T200000
DESCRIPTION:Harvest Festival returns with the Pokémon GO debut of Shiny Ap
 plin! Gather apples\, choose a Timed Research path\, and earn rewards thro
 ugh the event GO Pass.\nThe Harvest Festival 2026: Applin Picking event wi
 ll take place from September 29\, 2026 at 10 am to October 5\, 2026 at 8 p
 m local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Increased chance to encounter 
 Shiny Smoliv\nUnlock the following bonuses by reaching Major Milestones on
  the event GO Pass.\n\n▸ Tier 1 Bonus – Starting at Rank 1\n• Applin
  will have an increased chance of holding Tart Apples\, Sweet Apples\, or 
 Syrupy Apples when caught\n\n▸ Tier 2 Bonus – Starting at Rank 10\n•
  Mossy Lure Modules activated during the event will last for one hour\n\n
 ▸ Tier 3 Bonus – Starting at Rank 20\n• More Stardust from defeating
  Team GO Rocket Grunts and Leaders\nAdditional bonus tasks for this GO Pas
 s will be available during the event.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Apple
 s\nDuring the event\, Mossy Lure Modules will only attract apples. Tap the
 se apples to receive Tart Apples\, Sweet Apples\, Syrupy Apples\, or encou
 nters with event-themed Pokémon\, including Cottonee wearing a flower cro
 wn and Applin!\nPokémon: Flower Crown Cottonee\, Applin\n\n━━ SPAWNS 
 ━━\nThe following Pokémon and more will appear in the wild during the
  event.\nPokémon: Skwovet\, Lechonk\, Smoliv\nIf you’re lucky\, you mig
 ht also encounter Applin!\nPokémon: Applin\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸
  Branching Timed Research\nChoose one of three Timed Research paths to det
 ermine which apples you receive as rewards:\n• Tart Apples\n• Sweet Ap
 ples\n• Syrupy Apples\nComplete the Timed Research tasks and claim all r
 ewards by Monday\, October 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ Fiel
 d Research Task Encounters\nEvent-themed Field Research tasks will reward 
 encounters with event-themed Pokémon.\n\n━━ GO PASS ━━\n▸ GO Pa
 ss: Harvest Festival\nTrainers will automatically receive the free GO Pass
 : Harvest Festival on Tuesday\, September 29\, at 10:00 a.m. local time. C
 omplete Pass Tasks and collect GO Points to rank up and earn rewards until
  Monday\, October 5\, 2026\, at 8:00 p.m. local time.\n\n▸ GO Pass Delux
 e\nUpgrade to GO Pass Deluxe for US$4.99* for additional rewards and faste
 r progression. The GO Pass Deluxe + 6 Ranks option costs US$6.99* and gran
 ts enough GO Points to reach Rank 7.\nGO Pass Deluxe includes rewards from
  both the free and paid tracks. You can upgrade at any time during the eve
 nt and claim rewards from ranks you’ve already unlocked.\nAll unlocked G
 O Pass rewards must be claimed by Wednesday\, October 7\, 2026\, at 8:00 p
 .m. local time.\n\n▸ Featured Pokémon and Rewards\nThe free GO Pass inc
