SUMMARY:Harvest Festival: Taken Over
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261002T000000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261005T200000
DESCRIPTION:Rescue Shadow Zekrom as Team GO Rocket takes over the Harvest F
 estival!\nThe Harvest Festival: Taken Over event will take place from Octo
 ber 2\, 2026 at 12 am to October 5\, 2026 at 8 pm local time.\n\n━━ BO
 NUSES ━━\n• Increased chance to encounter Shiny Slugma\n• More Tea
 m GO Rocket appearances at PokéStops and in balloons\n• Use a Charged T
 M to remove Frustration from Shadow Pokémon\n• Wider Attack\, Defense\,
  and HP variance for Pokémon caught in one-star and three-star Shadow Rai
 ds during the event\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Save Shadow Zekrom!\nEa
 rn a Super Rocket Radar through GO Pass: Harvest Festival to track down Gi
 ovanni and rescue Shadow Zekrom. Giovanni will only appear at PokéStops.\
 nGO Pass rewards can be claimed until Wednesday\, October 7\, 2026\, at 8:
 00 pm local time.\nShadow Pokémon and Purified Pokémon cannot fuse with 
 other Pokémon.\nPokémon: Zekrom\n\n━━ SHADOW ━━\nTeam GO Rocket 
 Grunts and Leaders Sierra\, Cliff\, and Arlo will change their lineups. De
 feat Grunts to rescue these newly released Shadow Pokémon.\n\n▸ New Sha
 dow Pokémon\nPokémon: Wimpod\, Fomantis\, Sandygast\nCheck the Team GO R
 ocket lineups page for updates after the event begins.\n\n━━ SPAWNS 
 ━━\nEvent-themed wild encounters include the following Pokémon\, with
  more to discover.\nPokémon: Koffing\, Slugma\, Numel\nLucky Trainers may
  also encounter Magmar!\nPokémon: Magmar\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━━\n▸ F
 ield Research Tasks\nEvent Field Research will reward Fast TMs\, Charged T
 Ms\, and Mysterious Components. Tasks and item quantities have not been an
 nounced.\n• ??? → Fast TM ×?\, Charged TM ×?\, Mysterious Component 
 ×?\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\n▸ Shiny Shroodle Debut\nShiny Shroodle will 
 be available to hatch for the first time in Pokémon GO! Evolve Shiny Shro
 odle to obtain Shiny Grafaiai.\nPokémon: Shroodle\, Grafaiai\n\n▸ Incre
 ased Shiny Chance\nSlugma encounters will have an increased chance of bein
 g Shiny during the event.\nPokémon: Slugma\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/e
 vents/harvest-festival-taken-over-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/harvest-festival-taken-over-2026/
