BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:patterns-of-the-wild-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260919T080230Z
SUMMARY:Patterns of the Wild
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261002T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261002T200000
DESCRIPTION:This event is available only in Indonesia.\nNote: The original 
 announcement was updated to say this event is exclusive to Indonesia. It o
 riginally gave no indication that it was not a global event.\nPatterns of 
 the Wild brings a Special Background for Pikachu wearing a batik shirt\, a
 long with boosted wild encounters\, Incense bonuses\, and research rewards
 !\nThe event takes place on Friday\, October 2\, 2026\, from 10:00 a.m. to
  8:00 p.m. local time. Timed Research is available for a longer period\, f
 rom September 28 through October 7.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\n• Incense 
 will last for two hours\n• Increased chance to encounter Pikachu wearing
  a batik shirt and other event-themed Pokémon while using Incense\n• In
 creased chance to encounter Shiny featured wild Pokémon\n\n━━ FEATURE
 S ━━\n▸ Pikachu with a Special Background\nPikachu wearing a batik s
 hirt can have a Special Background for the first time in Pokémon GO! Look
  for it in the wild\, through Timed Research\, and in surprise snapshot en
 counters. Shiny Pikachu wearing a batik shirt will also be available.\nPok
 émon: Batik Shirt Pikachu\n\n▸ Surprise Encounters\nTake a snapshot of 
 one of your own Pokémon during the event for a chance at a surprise encou
 nter with Pikachu wearing a batik shirt. Snapshots of wild Pokémon will n
 ot trigger these encounters.\n\n━━ SPAWNS ━━\nThese Pokémon will 
 appear more often in the wild\, with an increased chance of encountering t
 heir Shiny variants. Pikachu wearing a batik shirt may have a Special Back
 ground.\nPokémon: Caterpie\, Batik Shirt Pikachu\, Oddish\, Gloom\, Bells
 prout\, Ledyba\, Ledian\, Hoppip\, Skiploom\, Sunkern\, Wurmple\n\n━━ 
 RESEARCH ━━\n▸ Timed Research\nTimed Research will run from Monday\,
  September 28\, at 6:00 a.m. to Wednesday\, October 7\, 2026\, at 11:59 p.
 m.\nRewards include an encounter with Pikachu wearing a batik shirt with a
  Special Background\, encounters with Oddish\, Ledyba\, and Hoppip\, 1\,00
 0 XP\, 1\,000 Stardust\, and more. Each of these Pokémon can be Shiny.\n\
 n▸ Timed Research Encounters\nPokémon: Batik Shirt Pikachu\, Oddish\, L
 edyba\, Hoppip\n\n▸ Collection Challenge\nCatch the required event-theme
 d Pokémon to earn XP\, Stardust\, and stickers of Pikachu wearing a batik
  shirt.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nThe featured wild Pokémon have an increas
 ed Shiny chance during the event.\nPokémon: Caterpie\, Batik Shirt Pikach
 u\, Oddish\, Gloom\, Bellsprout\, Ledyba\, Ledian\, Hoppip\, Skiploom\, Su
 nkern\, Wurmple\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/patterns-of-the-wild-2
 026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/patterns-of-the-wild-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gigantamax-cinderace-max-battle-day-2026@pokemon-go-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260919T080230Z
SUMMARY:Gigantamax Cinderace Max Battle Day
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261003T140000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Lisbon:20261003T170000
DESCRIPTION:The Gigantamax Cinderace Max Battle Day event will take place o
 n October 3\, 2026 from 2 pm to 5 pm local time.\n\n━━ BONUSES ━━\
 nThe following bonuses will be active during the event.\n• Max Particle 
 collection limit increased to 1\,600\n• All Power Spots will host Gigant
 amax Battles\n• Power Spots will refresh more frequently\n• Additional
  Power Spots will be active\n• 8× Max Particles from Power Spots\n• U
 p to three Special Trades for the day\n• From October 2 at 5:00 p.m. to 
 October 3 at 8:00 p.m. PDT (GMT −7)\, the daily Remote Raid limit will i
 ncrease from 10 to 20\nThe following bonuses will be active on October 3\,
  2026\, from 12:00 a.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n• 2× Max Particles fr
 om exploring*\n• 1/4 Adventuring distance to receive Max Particles**\n*T
 rainers can collect Max Particles via the Nearby menu each day by explorin
 g. Adventure Sync can help make sure your distance counts! Keep an eye on 
 the Nearby menu for the icon that shows when Max Particles are ready to co
 llect.\n**For these bonuses to apply\, Trainers must first collect all Max
  Particles available in the Nearby menu.\n\n▸ Event Ticket\nFor US$4.99 
 (or the equivalent pricing tier in your local currency)\, you’ll be able
  to access event-exclusive Timed Research.\nTimed Research rewards include
  the following.\n• 1 Max Mushroom\n• 25\,000 XP\n• 6\,400 Max Partic
 les\nYou’ll also receive the following bonus.\n• 2× XP from Max Battl
 es\nThis Timed Research will be effective on Saturday\, October 3\, 2026\,
  from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time.\n\n━━ FEATURES ━━\n▸ Fe
 atured Pokémon\nThe following Pokémon will appear in six-star Max Battle
 s!\nPokémon: Gigantamax Cinderace\nFor the first time in Pokémon GO\, yo
 u’ll be able to encounter Shiny Gigantamax Cinderace—if you’re lucky
 !\n\n▸ Where can I find Max Battles?\nMax Battles appear at Power Spots 
 and require teamwork. Use the Pokémon GO Map to find active battles and l
 ocations where battles may appear during the event.\nYou can also check ne
 arby events for community meetups hosted by Community Ambassadors\, or fin
 d your community to coordinate with other Trainers.\n\n━━ RESEARCH ━
 ━\n▸ Paid Timed Research\nFor US$4.99 (or the equivalent pricing tier 
 in your local currency)\, you’ll be able to access event-exclusive Timed
  Research\, which rewards 1 Max Mushroom\, 25\,000 XP\, 6\,400 Max Particl
 es\, and 2× XP from Max Battles.\nThe Timed Research is available on Satu
 rday\, October 3\, 2026\, from 2:00 p.m. to 5:00 p.m. local time. Tasks ha
 ve not yet been announced.\n\n━━ SHINY ━━\nShiny Gigantamax Cinder
 ace will be released with the start of the event.\nPokémon: Gigantamax Ci
 nderace\n\n🔗 https://leekduck.com/events/gigantamax-cinderace-max-battl
 e-day-2026/
URL:https://leekduck.com/events/gigantamax-cinderace-max-battle-day-2026/
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
